   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed transaction consists of: (i) a US$25 million senior loan to Danper Trujillo S.A.C. with a term of 10 years including a 2-year grace period, which will be used for agricultural and industrial investments in existing operations in Peru, as well as for structural working capital; and (ii) an unsecured and uncommitted revolving discount line of US$10 million granted to Danper Trujillo S.A.C. to promote financial support and ease of payment of suppliers that make up its supply chain in Peru (IDB Invest will purchase irrevocable and unconditional future-dated payment obligations/accounts payable denominated in US$).</narrative>
  </description>
